  "noLink": [
    "Reads (get, activity, notes, fields, picklists, connected email) change nothing.",
    "kylas_import: an import job has no page of its own in sd-ui (only the generic data-management screens), so it gets no link; its status is in the run's output.",
    "A failed, skipped or no-op call (an update that changed nothing, a send that did not go out) gets no link."
  ]
}
